    {
        "content": "<p>Could you somehow create a <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mwe.html\">#mwe</a>, perhaps by copying some of <code>TermCongr.lean</code> and then adding the faulty proofs afterwards?</p>",
        "id": 633628735,
        "sender_full_name": "Snir Broshi",
        "timestamp": 1792586573
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Without investigating, I think there is a difference how these two things handle (universe) metavariables. <br>\nI believe that <code>isDefEq</code> can assign metavariables in <code>pfTy</code>, but <code>isProp</code> just checks that something is always a proposition, independent of how metavariables are assigned.</p>",
        "id": 633630284,
        "sender_full_name": "Floris van Doorn",
        "timestamp": 1792586861
    }
]